#! tui-mockup 1
#! size: 180x48
#! caps: attrs=bold,dim,italic,underline,inverse colors=truecolor glyphs=unicode source=docs
#! title: osi — all · signal on every tile
#! state: signal
#! theme: catppuccin-mocha
#! note: data: six real orchestrations launched together by demo/multi/launch6.sh, four on cof and two on electricity, snapshotted 2.8 s in
#! note: invented: nothing; names, configs, pids, timings and tokens are the engines' own (snap6/manifest.json is what osi knew at launch)
#! note: every tile is a full osi on one run; the 0-3 keys switch the screen of every tile at once; arrows move the focus; enter opens the focused run
#! note: craft-ok CR6 tiles are sized by the grid, not by the shortest run; a tile's empty rows are where that run's steps will appear
#! region r1 header 0,0,180,1
#! region r2 chart 0,2,60,15 Signal · Sent Above · Received Below · Shared Scale
#! region r3 list 0,17,60,6 Now
#! region r4 chart 60,2,60,15 Signal · Sent Above · Received Below · Shared Scale
#! region r5 list 60,17,60,6 Now
#! region r6 chart 120,2,60,15 Signal · Sent Above · Received Below · Shared Scale
#! region r7 list 120,17,60,6 Now
#! region r8 chart 0,24,60,15 Signal · Sent Above · Received Below · Shared Scale
#! region r9 list 0,39,60,7 Now · 3 of 3 Slots Busy
#! region r10 chart 60,24,60,15 Signal · Sent Above · Received Below · Shared Scale
#! region r11 list 60,39,60,7 Now
#! region r12 chart 120,24,60,15 Signal · Sent Above · Received Below · Shared Scale
#! region r13 list 120,39,60,7 Now · 2 of 2 Slots Busy
#! region r14 keybar 0,47,180,1
#! focus r2
